{"title":"War of Corpses","synopsis":"Uce, seorang pemuda yang sedang sial, bermimpi menjadi juara dalam Perang Mayat yang brutal dan legendaris—sebuah olahraga di mana para necromancer dan ksatria mereka bertarung untuk supremasi. Dalam upaya putus asa, ia menghidupkan kembali Eleonora, mayat yang ditinggalkan yang mengklaim pernah menjadi tentara bayaran paling mematikan di dunia. Ada dua masalah besar, however. Pertama, Eleonora masih hidup—fakta yang tidak boleh terungkap dengan cara apa pun. Kedua, ia dan Uce tampaknya tidak bisa mengoordinasikan gerakan mereka. Bisakah duo yang tidak mungkin ini mengatasi semua rintangan, memenangkan Perang Mayat, dan membuktikan semua orang salah?","alternative_title":"The War of Corpses, War of the Corpses, 死体たちの闘い, 시체들의 전쟁","author":"Author Mayo Raccoon, MAYO-NUGURI","artist":"Mayo Raccoon, MAYO-NUGURI","genres":["Action","Drama","Fantasy","Seinen","Supernatural"],"chapters":[{"id":"ch_69","number":"69","title":"Chapter 69","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"id":"ch_68","number":"68","title":"Chapter 68","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"id":"ch_67","number":"67","title":"Chapter 67","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"id":"ch_66","number":"66","title":"Chapter 66","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"id":"ch_65","number":"65","title":"Chapter 65","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"id":"ch_64","number":"64","title":"Chapter 64","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"id":"ch_63","number":"63","title":"Chapter 63","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"id":"ch_62","number":"62","title":"Chapter 62","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"id":"ch_61","number":"61","title":"Chapter 61","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"id":"ch_60","number":"60","title":"Chapter 60","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"id":"ch_59","number":"59","title":"Chapter 59","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"id":"ch_58","number":"58","title":"Chapter 58","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"id":"ch_57","number":"57","title":"Chapter 57","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"